// title: Identity Blast Radius 2
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceLogonEvents, IdentityInfo
// purpose: Identity Blast Radius 2
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/Identity%20Blast%20Radius%202.kql
